OL,3,ATwo Italians killed after Iranian
OL,4,Astrike in Kuwait
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes just over a week after Kuwait
OL,7,Fsaid it had repelled overnight Iranian
OL,8,Fdrone attacks on an airbase which hosts
OL,9,FUS forces - the first strikes in more
OL,10,Fthan two months on the country.
